{"code":"bn","name":"Bengali","native":"বাংলা","phase":2,"medium":"en","file_level":"B2","level":{"title":"Advanced: conditionals, passive, debate, culture","goals":["Use যে-clauses and hypotheticals fluently","Use passives and compound verbs","Debate and discuss Bengali culture"],"units":[{"id":"B2-U1","title":"Conditionals and wishes","lessons":[{"id":"B2-U1-L1","title":"যে-clauses: চাই যে…","learn":"Wishes with যে! আমি চাই তুমি আসো (I want you to come). হয়তো… (maybe…), যাতে… (so that…), যেন… (as if…)! Simple verb + যে-clause = B2 wishes!","vocab":[{"t":"যে","r":"je","en":"that","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"হয়তো","r":"hôyto","en":"maybe","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"ইস","r":"ish","en":"if only / alas","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"যদি","r":"jodi","en":"if","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"তাহলে","r":"tahôle","en":"then","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"চাই","r":"chai","en":"want","pos":"verb"},{"t":"যাতে","r":"jate","en":"so that","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"যেন","r":"jæno","en":"as if","pos":"conjunction"}],"grammar":{"title":"চাই যে… · হয়তো · যাতে","explain":"আমি চাই তুমি আসো (I want you to come). হয়তো সে আসবে (maybe he'll come). যাতে তুমি বোঝো (so that you understand)!","pattern":"চাই (যে)… · হয়তো…বে · যাতে…","examples":[{"t":"আমি চাই তুমি আসো।","r":"ami chai tumi asho.","en":"I want you to come."},{"t":"হয়তো সে আসবে।","r":"hôyto she ashbe.","en":"Maybe he/she will come."},{"t":"যাতে আমরা খেলি।","r":"jate amra kheli.","en":"So that we play."}],"mistakes":["Saying চাই without subject — চাই needs আমি/আপনি!","Saying হয়তো আসে — হয়তো loves আসবে!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমি চাই তুমি আসো।","r":"ami chai tumi asho.","en":"I want you to come."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"হয়তো আসবো!","r":"hôyto ashbo!","en":"Maybe I'll come!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"যাতে আমরা খেলি!","r":"jate amra kheli!","en":"So that we play!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"ঠিক আছে!","r":"ṭhik achhe!","en":"OK!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I want you to come","answer":"আমি চাই তুমি আসো"},{"type":"fill","q":"হয়তো সে ___। (will come)","answer":"আসবে"},{"type":"choose","q":"'So that we play' is…","options":["যাতে আমরা খেলি","যাতে আমরা খেলবো","যাতে আমরা খেলো","যাতে আমরা খেলছি"],"answer":"যাতে আমরা খেলি"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: আসো / তুমি / চাই / আমি","answer":"আমি চাই তুমি আসো"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: হয়তো আসবো!","answer":"হয়তো আসবো!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আমি চাই তুমি আসো means…","options":["I come","I want you to come","you want me","we come"],"answer":1,"why":"চাই + clause = want-that."},{"q":"হয়তো সে আসবে means…","options":["he will come","maybe he'll come","he came","he must come"],"answer":1,"why":"হয়তো + future = maybe."},{"q":"যাতে means…","options":["because","so that","although","until"],"answer":1,"why":"যাতে = purpose."},{"q":"যেন means…","options":["maybe","as if","because","then"],"answer":1,"why":"যেন = as-if."},{"q":"ইস means…","options":["maybe","if only / alas","because","then"],"answer":1,"why":"ইস = wistful sigh."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"যে-clauses worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["that","maybe","so that"],"key":["যে","হয়তো","যাতে"]},{"instruction":"Wishes.","items":["I want you to come","Maybe he/she will come","So that we play"],"key":["আমি চাই তুমি আসো","হয়তো সে আসবে","যাতে আমরা খেলি"]},{"instruction":"Invite.","items":["Maybe I'll come!","OK!"],"key":["হয়তো আসবো","ঠিক আছে"]}]}},{"id":"B2-U1-L2","title":"যদি…তাহলে + হতো","learn":"Dream-grammar! যদি বৃষ্টি হতো, তাহলে বাড়ি থাকতাম (If it rained, I'd stay home). যদি + past, তাহলে + -তাম/-তো! নইলে (otherwise), ইস (if only)!","vocab":[{"t":"যদি","r":"jodi","en":"if","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"তাহলে","r":"tahôle","en":"then","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"নইলে","r":"noile","en":"otherwise","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"হতো","r":"hôto","en":"would be","pos":"verb"},{"t":"থাকতাম","r":"thaktam","en":"would stay (I)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"যেতাম","r":"jetam","en":"would go (I)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"করতাম","r":"kôrtam","en":"would do (I)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ইস","r":"ish","en":"if only","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"যদি + past, তাহলে + -তাম/-তো","explain":"যদি টাকা থাকতো, তাহলে বেড়াতাম (if I had money, I'd travel). যদি তুমি আসতে! (if only you came)!","pattern":"যদি…তাহলে…+ তো/তাম","examples":[{"t":"যদি বৃষ্টি হতো, তাহলে বাড়ি থাকতাম।","r":"jodi brishṭi hôto, tahôle baṛi thaktam.","en":"If it rained, I'd stay home."},{"t":"যদি টাকা থাকতো, তাহলে বেড়াতাম।","r":"jodi ṭaka thakto, tahôle beṛatam.","en":"If I had money, I'd travel."},{"t":"ইস, তুমি যদি আসতে!","r":"ish, tumi jodi ashte!","en":"If only you came!"}],"mistakes":["Saying যদি…বে — hypotheticals use -তো/-তাম, not -বে!","Forgetting তাহলে: যদি…তাহলে — a pair!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"যদি টাকা থাকতো, তাহলে কী করতে?","r":"jodi ṭaka thakto, tahôle ki kôrte?","en":"If you had money, what would you do?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"বেড়াতাম!","r":"beṛatam!","en":"I'd travel!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"ইস! নইলে বাড়ি থাকবো।","r":"ish! noile baṛi thakbo.","en":"If only! Otherwise I'll stay home."},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"কোনো ব্যাপার না!","r":"kono byapar na!","en":"No problem!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: If it rained, I'd stay home","answer":"যদি বৃষ্টি হতো, তাহলে বাড়ি থাকতাম"},{"type":"fill","q":"ইস, তুমি যদি ___! (came-hypo)","answer":"আসতে"},{"type":"choose","q":"'If I had money, I'd travel' is…","options":["যদি টাকা আছে, তাহলে বেড়াবো","যদি টাকা থাকতো, তাহলে বেড়াতাম","যদি টাকা ছিল, তাহলে বেড়ালাম","যদি টাকা হবে, তাহলে বেড়াবো"],"answer":"যদি টাকা থাকতো, তাহলে বেড়াতাম"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: থাকতাম / বাড়ি / তাহলে / হতো / বৃষ্টি / যদি","answer":"যদি বৃষ্টি হতো তাহলে বাড়ি থাকতাম"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ইস, তুমি যদি আসতে!","answer":"ইস, তুমি যদি আসতে!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"যদি…তাহলে uses…","options":["-বে future","-তো/-তাম","-ছি","imperative"],"answer":1,"why":"Hypothetical = -তো forms."},{"q":"থাকতাম means…","options":["stay (habit)","would stay (I)","stayed","will stay"],"answer":1,"why":"-তাম = hypothetical-I."},{"q":"নইলে means…","options":["because","otherwise","although","then"],"answer":1,"why":"নইলে = else/otherwise."},{"q":"ইস, তুমি যদি আসতে means…","options":["you came","if only you came","you will come","you must come"],"answer":1,"why":"ইস = wistful wish."},{"q":"তাহলে pairs with…","options":["কিন্তু","যদি","কারণ","যখন"],"answer":1,"why":"যদি…তাহলে — if…then."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Hypotheticals worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["if","then","otherwise"],"key":["যদি","তাহলে","নইলে"]},{"instruction":"Dream.","items":["If it rained, I'd stay home","If I had money, I'd travel","If only you came!"],"key":["যদি বৃষ্টি হতো, তাহলে বাড়ি থাকতাম","যদি টাকা থাকতো, তাহলে বেড়াতাম","ইস, তুমি যদি আসতে"]},{"instruction":"Chat.","items":["If you had money, what would you do?","I'd travel!"],"key":["যদি টাকা থাকতো, তাহলে কী করতে","বেড়াতাম"]}]}}]},{"id":"B2-U2","title":"Passive and debate","lessons":[{"id":"B2-U2-L1","title":"Passive: খাওয়া হয়","learn":"Things GET done! ভাত খাওয়া হয় (rice is eaten), বই লেখা হলো (the book was written). Stem + আ + হয়/হলো! Compounds: খেয়ে ফেললাম (ate it up), করে দিলাম (did it)!","vocab":[{"t":"হওয়া","r":"hôa","en":"to be (passive aux)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"পারা","r":"para","en":"can (able)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ফেলা","r":"fæla","en":"to do completely","pos":"verb"},{"t":"নেওয়া","r":"neoa","en":"to take (compound)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"খাওয়া হয়","r":"khaoa hôy","en":"is eaten","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"বানানো হলো","r":"banano hôlo","en":"was made","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"লেখা হলো","r":"lekha hôlo","en":"was written","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"বোঝা গেল","r":"bojha gælo","en":"was understood","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"Stem + আ হয়/হলো · compounds","explain":"ভাত খাওয়া হয় (rice is eaten), বাড়ি বানানো হলো (house was built). Compounds: খেয়ে ফেললাম (ate it up), করে দিলাম (did it — away)!","pattern":"আ হয়/হলো · এ + ফেলা/দেওয়া","examples":[{"t":"ভাত খাওয়া হয়।","r":"bhat khaoa hôy.","en":"Rice is eaten."},{"t":"ভাত খেয়ে ফেললাম।","r":"bhat kheye fellam.","en":"I ate up the rice."},{"t":"বই লেখা হলো।","r":"boi lekha hôlo.","en":"The book was written."}],"mistakes":["Saying ভাত খায় for passive — passive: খাওয়া হয়!","Mixing ফেলা/দেওয়া: ফেলা = up, দেওয়া = away!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"ভাত খাওয়া হলো?","r":"bhat khaoa hôlo?","en":"Was the rice eaten?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"হ্যাঁ, খেয়ে ফেললাম!","r":"hyãn, kheye fellam!","en":"Yes, I ate it up!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"বই লেখা হলো?","r":"boi lekha hôlo?","en":"Was the book written?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"হ্যাঁ, লেখা হলো!","r":"hyãn, lekha hôlo!","en":"Yes, written!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Rice is eaten","answer":"ভাত খাওয়া হয়"},{"type":"fill","q":"বই ___ হলো। (written)","answer":"লেখা"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I ate up the rice' is…","options":["ভাত খেলাম","ভাত খেয়ে ফেললাম","আমি ভাত খাই","ভাত খাওয়া হয়"],"answer":"ভাত খেয়ে ফেললাম"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: হয় / খাওয়া / ভাত","answer":"ভাত খাওয়া হয়"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ভাত খাওয়া হয়।","answer":"ভাত খাওয়া হয়।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"খাওয়া হয় means…","options":["eats","is eaten","ate","will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"আ + হয় = passive."},{"q":"লেখা হলো means…","options":["writes","was written","will write","is writing"],"answer":1,"why":"আ + হলো = past-passive."},{"q":"খেয়ে ফেললাম adds…","options":["nothing","completion (up)","question","future"],"answer":1,"why":"ফেলা = up/completely."},{"q":"পারা means…","options":["must","can (able)","want","finish"],"answer":1,"why":"পারা = be-able."},{"q":"বোঝা গেল means…","options":["understands","was understood","will understand","don't understand"],"answer":1,"why":"বোঝা + গেল = got-understood."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Passive worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["to be (passive)","can (able)","was made"],"key":["হওয়া","পারা","বানানো হলো"]},{"instruction":"Passives.","items":["Rice is eaten","The book was written","I ate up the rice"],"key":["ভাত খাওয়া হয়","বই লেখা হলো","ভাত খেয়ে ফেললাম"]},{"instruction":"Check.","items":["Was the rice eaten?","Yes!"],"key":["ভাত খাওয়া হলো","হ্যাঁ"]}]}},{"id":"B2-U2-L2","title":"Debate connectors","learn":"Argue in Bengali! যদিও (although), তাই (that's why), এছাড়া (besides), অন্যদিকে (on the other hand), সংক্ষেপে (in short), আসলে (actually)!","vocab":[{"t":"যদিও","r":"jodio","en":"although","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"তাই","r":"tai","en":"that's why / so","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"এছাড়া","r":"echhaṛa","en":"besides","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"অন্যদিকে","r":"onyodike","en":"on the other hand","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"সংক্ষেপে","r":"shôngkhepe","en":"in short","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"আসলে","r":"ashole","en":"actually","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"সত্যি বলতে","r":"shotti bôlte","en":"frankly","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"মোটের উপর","r":"moṭer upor","en":"overall","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"Connector chains","explain":"মেট্রো ভালো, যদিও ভিড়। এছাড়া সস্তা! তাই মেট্রোতে যাই। (The metro is good, although crowded. Besides, cheap! So I go by metro!)","pattern":"যদিও… এছাড়া… তাই…","examples":[{"t":"মেট্রো ভালো, যদিও ভিড়।","r":"meṭro bhalo, jodio bhiṛ.","en":"The metro is good, although crowded."},{"t":"এছাড়া সস্তা!","r":"echhaṛa shôsta!","en":"Besides, it's cheap!"},{"t":"তাই মেট্রোতে যাই।","r":"tai meṭrote jai.","en":"So I go by metro."}],"mistakes":["Stopping at কিন্তু — add যদিও + এছাড়া!","Saying তাই at sentence END — তাই starts!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"মেট্রো ভালো, যদিও ভিড়।","r":"meṭro bhalo, jodio bhiṛ.","en":"The metro is good, although crowded."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"কিন্তু গাড়ি দ্রুত!","r":"kintu gaṛi druto!","en":"But the car is fast!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"এছাড়া মেট্রো সস্তা!","r":"echhaṛa meṭro shôsta!","en":"Besides, the metro is cheap!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"সংক্ষেপে, দুটোই ভালো!","r":"shôngkhepe, duṭoi bhalo!","en":"In short, both are good!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: So I go by metro","answer":"তাই মেট্রোতে যাই"},{"type":"fill","q":"___, দুটোই ভালো! (In short)","answer":"সংক্ষেপে"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Although' is…","options":["তাই","যদিও","এছাড়া","সংক্ষেপে"],"answer":"যদিও"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: যাই / মেট্রোতে / তাই","answer":"তাই মেট্রোতে যাই"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: তাই মেট্রোতে যাই।","answer":"তাই মেট্রোতে যাই।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"যদিও means…","options":["because","although","that's why","in short"],"answer":1,"why":"যদিও = although."},{"q":"তাই means…","options":["although","besides","that's why","in short"],"answer":2,"why":"তাই = so/therefore."},{"q":"এছাড়া means…","options":["however","besides","therefore","although"],"answer":1,"why":"এছাড়া = besides."},{"q":"সংক্ষেপে means…","options":["in short","for example","of course","by the way"],"answer":0,"why":"সংক্ষেপে = in short."},{"q":"আসলে means…","options":["frankly","actually","finally","nearly"],"answer":1,"why":"আসলে = in reality."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Debate worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["although","that's why","besides"],"key":["যদিও","তাই","এছাড়া"]},{"instruction":"Argue.","items":["The metro is good, although crowded","Besides, it's cheap","So I go by metro"],"key":["মেট্রো ভালো, যদিও ভিড়","এছাড়া সস্তা","তাই মেট্রোতে যাই"]},{"instruction":"Conclude.","items":["In short, both are good!","So I go by metro"],"key":["সংক্ষেপে, দুটোই ভালো","তাই মেট্রোতে যাই"]}]}}]},{"id":"B2-U3","title":"Culture and mastery","lessons":[{"id":"B2-U3-L1","title":"আতিথেয়তা and festivals","learn":"অতিথি ভগবান — the guest is god! আসুন (please come!), খান (please eat!), চা নিন (have tea)! Festivals: দুর্গাপূজা (Durga Puja), পহেলা বৈশাখ (New Year)!","vocab":[{"t":"ডাল","r":"ḍal","en":"lentils","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ভাত","r":"bhat","en":"rice","pos":"noun"},{"t":"দুর্গাপূজা","r":"Durgapuja","en":"Durga Puja","pos":"noun"},{"t":"পহেলা বৈশাখ","r":"Pôhela Boishakh","en":"Bengali New Year","pos":"noun"},{"t":"অতিথি","r":"otithi","en":"guest","pos":"noun"},{"t":"মেহমান","r":"mehman","en":"guest","pos":"noun"},{"t":"আসুন","r":"ashun","en":"please come","pos":"verb"},{"t":"চা","r":"cha","en":"tea","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"আসুন · খান · অতিথি ভগবান","explain":"আসুন! (please come!), ভাত খান! (please eat rice!), চা নিন! (have tea!). অতিথি ভগবান = the guest is god!","pattern":"আসুন · খান · নিন","examples":[{"t":"আসুন! ভাত খান!","r":"ashun! bhat khan!","en":"Come in! Please eat rice!"},{"t":"চা নিন!","r":"cha nin!","en":"Have tea!"},{"t":"অতিথি ভগবান।","r":"otithi bhôgoban.","en":"The guest is god."}],"mistakes":["Saying এসো to guests — guests get আসুন!","Rushing guests — আতিথেয়তা needs time!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আসুন! ভাত খান!","r":"ashun! bhat khan!","en":"Come in! Please eat rice!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"ধন্যবাদ! রান্না খুব ভালো!","r":"dhonyobad! ranna khub bhalo!","en":"Thanks! The cooking is very good!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"চা নিন!","r":"cha nin!","en":"Have tea!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"হ্যাঁ, দয়া করে!","r":"hyãn, dôya kôre!","en":"Yes, please!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Come in! Please eat rice!","answer":"আসুন! ভাত খান"},{"type":"fill","q":"চা ___! (have/take)","answer":"নিন"},{"type":"choose","q":"'The guest is god' is…","options":["মেহমান ভালো","অতিথি ভগবান","আসুন খান","চা নিন"],"answer":"অতিথি ভগবান"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: খান / ভাত / আসুন","answer":"আসুন ভাত খান"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আসুন! ভাত খান!","answer":"আসুন! ভাত খান!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আসুন means…","options":["goodbye","please come","thank you","excuse me"],"answer":1,"why":"আসুন = formal come!"},{"q":"ভাত খান means…","options":["I eat rice","please eat rice","he eats rice","don't eat"],"answer":1,"why":"খান = formal eat!"},{"q":"অতিথি ভগবান means…","options":["love food","the guest is god","welcome home","eat well"],"answer":1,"why":"Hospitality motto!."},{"q":"দুর্গাপূজা is…","options":["new year","Durga Puja festival","harvest","wedding"],"answer":1,"why":"দুর্গাপূজা = biggest Bengali festival."},{"q":"পহেলা বৈশাখ is…","options":["a food","Bengali New Year","a dance","winter"],"answer":1,"why":"পহেলা বৈশাখ = New Year."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Hospitality worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["lentils","guest","tea"],"key":["ডাল","অতিথি","চা"]},{"instruction":"Host guests.","items":["Come in! Please eat rice!","Have tea!","The guest is god"],"key":["আসুন! ভাত খান","চা নিন","অতিথি ভগবান"]},{"instruction":"Be a guest.","items":["Thanks! The cooking is very good!","Yes, please!"],"key":["ধন্যবাদ! রান্না খুব ভালো","হ্যাঁ, দয়া করে"]}]}},{"id":"B2-U3-L2","title":"Storytelling: একবার","learn":"Graduation! একবার (once), একদিন (one day), হঠাৎ (suddenly), অবশেষে (at last), শেষে (in the end). Mix tenses: গেলাম, খাচ্ছিলাম, খাবো! Tell YOUR Dhaka story!","vocab":[{"t":"একবার","r":"ækbar","en":"once","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"একদিন","r":"ækdin","en":"one day","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"হঠাৎ","r":"hôṭhat","en":"suddenly","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"অবশেষে","r":"obosheshe","en":"at last","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"শেষে","r":"sheshe","en":"in the end","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"আসলে","r":"ashole","en":"actually","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"দুঃখের বিষয়","r":"dukkher bishôy","en":"sadly / pity","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"সৌভাগ্যবশত","r":"shoubhagyobôshoto","en":"luckily","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"Story spine: একবার…শেষে","explain":"একবার…একদিন…হঠাৎ…অবশেষে…শেষে — the five-beat Bengali story spine. Mix গেলাম + খাচ্ছিলাম + খাবো!","pattern":"একবার → একদিন → হঠাৎ → শেষে","examples":[{"t":"একবার ঢাকায় গেলাম।","r":"ækbar Ḍhakay gælam.","en":"Once I went to Dhaka."},{"t":"হঠাৎ বৃষ্টি হলো!","r":"hôṭhat brishṭi hôlo!","en":"Suddenly it rained!"},{"t":"শেষে বাড়ি এলাম।","r":"sheshe baṛi elam.","en":"In the end I came home."}],"mistakes":["Starting tales with গতকাল — stories open একবার!","Using only গেলাম — mix ছিল + বে + যদি!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"তোমার গল্প বলো!","r":"tomar gôlpo bôlo!","en":"Tell your story! (casual)"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"একবার ঢাকায় গেলাম। আবহাওয়া ভালো ছিল।","r":"ækbar Ḍhakay gælam. abhaoa bhalo chhilo.","en":"Once I went to Dhaka. The weather was good."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"তারপর কী হলো?","r":"tarpôr ki hôlo?","en":"Then what happened?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"হঠাৎ বৃষ্টি হলো! শেষে বাড়ি এলাম!","r":"hôṭhat brishṭi hôlo! sheshe baṛi elam!","en":"Suddenly it rained! In the end I came home!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Once I went to Dhaka","answer":"একবার ঢাকায় গেলাম"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ বৃষ্টি হলো! (Suddenly)","answer":"হঠাৎ"},{"type":"choose","q":"Stories open with…","options":["গতকাল","একবার","আগামীকাল","আজ"],"answer":"একবার"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: হলো / বৃষ্টি / হঠাৎ","answer":"হঠাৎ বৃষ্টি হলো"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: একবার ঢাকায় গেলাম।","answer":"একবার ঢাকায় গেলাম।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"একবার means…","options":["every time","once","twice","never"],"answer":1,"why":"Story opener."},{"q":"হঠাৎ means…","options":["slowly","suddenly","finally","then"],"answer":1,"why":"হঠাৎ = suddenly."},{"q":"শেষে means…","options":["at first","in the end","suddenly","actually"],"answer":1,"why":"শেষে = in the end."},{"q":"দুঃখের বিষয় means…","options":["luckily","sadly / pity","angrily","quickly"],"answer":1,"why":"দুঃখের বিষয় = sad matter."},{"q":"আসলে means…","options":["finally","actually","suddenly","luckily"],"answer":1,"why":"আসলে = actually."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Storytelling worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["once","suddenly","in the end"],"key":["একবার","হঠাৎ","শেষে"]},{"instruction":"Spine a story.","items":["Once I went to Dhaka","Suddenly it rained","In the end I came home"],"key":["একবার ঢাকায় গেলাম","হঠাৎ বৃষ্টি হলো","শেষে বাড়ি এলাম"]},{"instruction":"Tell it.","items":["Tell your story! (casual)","The weather was good"],"key":["তোমার গল্প বলো","আবহাওয়া ভালো ছিল"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"B2 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I want you to come","answer":"আমি চাই তুমি আসো"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: If it rained, I'd stay home","answer":"যদি বৃষ্টি হতো, তাহলে বাড়ি থাকতাম"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Rice is eaten'","options":["ভাত খায়","ভাত খাওয়া হয়","ভাত খেয়ে ফেললাম","ভাত খাবে"],"answer":"ভাত খাওয়া হয়"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"এছাড়া মেট্রো সস্তা!","answer":"Besides, the metro is cheap!"},{"type":"fill","q":"হয়তো সে ___। (will come)","answer":"আসবে"},{"type":"choose","q":"'The guest is god'","options":["মেহমান ভালো","অতিথি ভগবান","আসুন খান","চা নিন"],"answer":"অতিথি ভগবান"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: হলো / বৃষ্টি / হঠাৎ","answer":"হঠাৎ বৃষ্টি হলো"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আসুন! ভাত খান!","answer":"আসুন! ভাত খান!"},{"type":"fill","q":"___, দুটোই ভালো! (In short)","answer":"সংক্ষেপে"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Come in! Please eat rice!","answer":"আসুন! ভাত খান"}]}}}